<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<Defs>
  <HediffDef ParentName="EH_ElementalHeartHediffBase">
    <defName>EH_EclipseAscendant</defName>
    <label>Eclipse Ascendant</label>
    <description>Evolved Lunar royalty commands Dusk Crescent, Umbral Pursuit, Crimson Waltz, Riven Horizon, Nightfall Reversal and Sovereign Eclipse. Caster-owned Eclipse Brands strengthen finishers. Ivory regalia, a bone half-mask, Eventide, an open-ring halo and Bestow: Lunar. Grants 500% elemental movement, +50 mood, evolved defense and recovery. A real eclipse raises core combat stats to Celestial level and adds 15% ability damage. Fighting with two visible enemies within five cells gives a 15% eclipse-summon roll every ten seconds: six in-game hours of eclipse, with a shared one-day cooldown. Natural eclipses also empower this lineage.

Damage: this lineage multiplies the Melee damage stat by 2.65 (+165%). The shared 20% reduction makes an otherwise identical eligible physical melee packet 2.12 times its unascended value before armor and other modifiers. This is not a fixed skill-damage value: techniques scale from the current melee profile and use their own multipliers, marks and, where applicable, separate elemental hits. Do not apply the lineage multiplier a second time to the weapon profile.</description>
    <comps>
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.HediffCompProperties_EclipseAbilities" />
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.HediffCompProperties_FlameRecovery">
        <sealAfterTicks>120</sealAfterTicks>
        <healPerSecond>3</healPerSecond>
      </li>
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.HediffCompProperties_EclipseMastery" />
    </comps>
    <stages>
      <li>
